Claude Code writes these during the run, per ../DOCS-SPEC.md:

  00-brief.md        what the problem is, inputs, output, traps
  01-architecture.md pipeline stages + Mermaid BUILD diagram
  02-decisions.md    running decision log, newest first
  03-trace.md        one real record followed through every stage
  04-production.md   Mermaid PRODUCTION diagram + 11 scale questions
  05-limits.md       what is genuinely fragile
  06-future.md       staged extension path + Mermaid EXTENSION diagram
  07-evaluation.md   per-field accuracy, iterations, cost and latency
